{"strongs": "H1586", "word": "גֹּ֫מָר", "translit": "go.mer", "root": "גמר", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name", "gloss": "son of Japhet", "definition": "גֹּ֫מָר proper name 1.masculine a. son of Japhet Gen 10:2 ; Gen 10:3 = 1Chr 1:5 ; 1Chr 1:6 ; Ezek 38:6 Lag Onom. Sacr. 2, 95, 2nd ed. 367, see BN 77 proposes גמרים for גמדים Ezek 27:11 q. v.; he identification גֹּמֶר with Cappadocia (compare ᵑ7 Ezek 27:11 , Kiep Lb. d. alt. Geogr. 91 ) = Armenian Gamir - χ (with plural ending) see also Lag Arm. Stud. 32 § 448 ; compare further Assyrian Gimirrai , Schr KG 157 ff. Dl Pa 245 f. also Len Or.ii. 1, 332 ff. 2. feminine wife of Hosea , Hos 1:3 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1693')\">BDB1693</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H1586')\">H1586</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1692')\">BDB1692</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1694')\">BDB1694</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>גֹּ֫מָר</bdbheb> <b>proper name</b> <div class=\"point\"><b>1.masculine a.</b> <highlightword>son of Japhet</highlightword> <ref ref=\"Gen 10:2\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(1,10,2)\">Gen 10:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 10:3\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(1,10,3)\">Gen 10:3</ref> = <ref ref=\"1Chr 1:5\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(13,1,5)\">1Chr 1:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 1:6\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(13,1,6)\">1Chr 1:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 38:6\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(26,38,6)\">Ezek 38:6</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Lag')\">Lag<sup>Onom. Sacr. 2, 95, 2nd ed. 367, see BN 77</sup></lookup> proposes <bdbheb>גמרים</bdbheb> for <bdbheb>גמדים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 27:11\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(26,27,11)\">Ezek 27:11</ref> q. v.; he identification <bdbheb>גֹּמֶ